  c#/TenantPoolForecast project.

  IMPORTANT — Integration Studio regeneration:
  This .csproj is regenerated by Integration Studio on every Source-code-edit cycle. The block
  below labelled FORECAST_DEPENDENCIES — which contains both the PackageReference items and
