  to be reapplied if the project is regenerated. The implementation files themselves
  (PerWeekdaySsaForecaster.cs, SarimaModel.cs, SarimaForecaster.cs, SarimaForecastOptions.cs,
  SsaForecastOptions.cs, ZScoreFilter.cs, TenantInputOutput.cs) live alongside
  ODCTenantPoolSize.cs and survive regeneration.
-->
